  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Temperature Converter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Temperature Converter</h1>\n    <p class=\"formula\">C→F: x*9/5+32 &nbsp;|&nbsp; F→C: (x-32)*5/9</p>\n    <label for=\"temperature\">Temperature</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" id=\"temperature\" placeholder=\"e.g. 25\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    <label for=\"direction\">Direction</label>\n    <select id=\"direction\">\n      <option value=\"c-to-f\">Celsius → Fahrenheit</option>\n      <option value=\"f-to-c\">Fahrenheit → Celsius</option>\n    </select>\n    <button id=\"convert\">Convert</button>\n    <output id=\"result\" for=\"temperature direction\">--</output>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #eaeaea;\n  --muted: #9a9ab0;\n}\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  padding: 28px 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 380px;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #0f0f1a;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\nh1 {\n  margin: 0 0 4px;\n  font-size: 1.35rem;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n.formula {\n  margin: 0 0 8px;\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\nlabel {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  margin-top: 4px;\n}\ninput, select, button {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--muted);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  outline: none;\n}\ninput:focus, select:focus {\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(233, 69, 96, 0.35);\n}\nbutton {\n  margin-top: 8px;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  color: #fff;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: transform 0.08s, box-shadow 0.08s;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #0f0f1a;\n}\nbutton:hover { background: #ff5c78; border-color: #ff5c78; }\nbutton:focus-visible { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(233, 69, 96, 0.5), 4px 4px 0 #0f0f1a; }\nbutton:active { transform: translate(3px, 3px); box-shadow: 1px 1px 0 #0f0f1a; }\n#result {\n  margin-top: 10px;\n  padding: 12px;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border: 3px dashed var(--muted);\n  color: var(--accent);\n  min-height: 56px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n@media (max-width: 360px) {\n  .card { padding: 20px 16px; }\n  h1 { font-size: 1.15rem; }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const tempInput = document.getElementById('temperature');\nconst direction = document.getElementById('direction');\nconst convertBtn = document.getElementById('convert');\nconst result = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction convert() {\n  const raw = tempInput.value.trim();\n  if (raw === '') {\n    result.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n  const x = Number(raw);\n  if (!Number.isFinite(x)) {\n    result.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n  let out;\n  if (direction.value === 'c-to-f') {\n    out = x * 9 / 5 + 32;\n  } else {\n    out = (x - 32) * 5 / 9;\n  }\n  if (!Number.isFinite(out)) {\n    result.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n  result.textContent = out.toFixed(2);\n}\n\nconvertBtn.addEventListener('click', convert);\ntempInput.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n  if (e.key === 'Enter') convert();\n});\ndirection.addEventListener('change', () => {\n  if (tempInput.value.trim() !== '') convert();\n});\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Temperature Converter\n\nA tiny offline pixel-style temperature converter built with plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript. No packages, no network requests, no storage.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a numeric temperature in the **Temperature** field.\n3. Choose a direction:\n   - `Celsius → Fahrenheit`\n   - `Fahrenheit → Celsius`\n4. Click **Convert** (or press Enter).\n\nThe result appears with exactly two decimal places, without units. Empty or invalid (non-finite) input displays `Error`.\n\n## Formulas\n\n- Celsius to Fahrenheit: `x * 9 / 5 + 32`\n- Fahrenheit to Celsius: `(x - 32) * 5 / 9`\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – markup and required element IDs (`temperature`, `direction`, `convert`, `result`).\n- `style.css` – pixel-themed responsive styling.\n- `script.js` – conversion logic and event listeners.\n\n## Accessibility\n\nAll controls are keyboard accessible and labeled. Focus, hover and pressed states are visible.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
